1. Animation Performance:
   - Monitor frame rate impact
   - Test native driver usage
   - Verify cleanup handling
   - Validate memory impact

2. Resource Management:
   - Test cleanup functions
   - Verify subscription handling
   - Check memory leaks
   - Monitor re-render counts

### Error Handling
// Implementation of:
// - @battle-core-mechanics.mdc#Error-Prevention#Testing
// - @battle-performance-standards.mdc#Error-Handling#Validation

1. Error Cases:
   - Invalid props
   - Missing dependencies
   - Animation failures
   - State conflicts
   - Network issues

2. Recovery Testing:
   - Error boundary behavior
   - Fallback rendering
   - State recovery
   - Animation reset

## Quality Gates
// Implementation of:
// - @project-structure.mdc#Quality-Gates
// - @battle-core-mechanics.mdc#Development-Guidelines#Testing

### Test Coverage Requirements
1. MVP Phase:
   - Critical paths: 100%
   - Business logic: 95%
   - UI components: 90%
   - Utilities: 85%

2. Production Phase:
   - Critical paths: 100%
   - Business logic: 98%
   - UI components: 95%
   - Utilities: 90%

### Test Quality Metrics
1. Required Aspects:
   - Meaningful assertions
   - Edge case coverage
   - Error handling
   - Performance impact
   - Memory management

2. Code Quality:
   - No duplicate tests
   - Clear descriptions
   - Proper mocking
   - Efficient setup
   - Clean teardown

Remember: These standards ensure consistent, reliable testing across the codebase. Update this document as new testing patterns and requirements emerge. 